(4208281, 606712, 65234, '<td valign="top">This may well be new to Pete (whoever or whereever he is) but nothing in the picture is telling me that.  It does look nicely redone so maybe newly restored would work better as a concept to fit the picture into the challenge.  That said ... I would like a much closer crop as I don''t think the background adds anything to what is an interesting car, and the background colors seem a little too magenta which is not at all complementary to the car.</td>', 'This may well be new to Pete (whoever or whereever he is) but nothing in the picture is telling me that.  It does look nicely redone so maybe newly restored would work better as a concept to fit the picture into the challenge.  That said ... I would like a much closer crop as I don''t think the background adds anything to what is an interesting car, and the background colors seem a little too magenta which is not at all complementary to the car.', '2007-10-31 10:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4208285, 604740, 72670, '<td valign="top">I like the negative space. This is great! what lens did you use? You might want to boost saturation next time. The letters seem a little grey. Nice job not blowing out the whites.</td>', 'I like the negative space. This is great! what lens did you use? You might want to boost saturation next time. The letters seem a little grey. Nice job not blowing out the whites.', '2007-10-31 10:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
