(4208836, 606156, 52500, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t scream New to me, and it''s really small.  You''re missing out on all of those pixels!  Those things aside, I really like the shot.  Photos of fish are tough, and you did really well with this one.  As much as I personally like the shot, I can''t score it well for this challenge at this size.</td>', 'This doesn''t scream New to me, and it''s really small.  You''re missing out on all of those pixels!  Those things aside, I really like the shot.  Photos of fish are tough, and you did really well with this one.  As much as I personally like the shot, I can''t score it well for this challenge at this size.', '2007-10-31 14:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4208837, 604484, 84576, '<td valign="top">Very intriguing image. Beautifully framed.</td>', 'Very intriguing image. Beautifully framed.', '2007-10-31 14:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
