(4208864, 606524, 52500, '<td valign="top">This has to be Rowan.  Well done, Tim (or Aimee I guess, but it looks like a Tim)!  Beautiful portrait, and the B/W serves it well.</td>', 'This has to be Rowan.  Well done, Tim (or Aimee I guess, but it looks like a Tim)!  Beautiful portrait, and the B/W serves it well.', '2007-10-31 15:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
