(4209044, 605614, 76598, '<td valign="top">lacks interest, too much glare, contrast doesn''t work for me</td>', 'lacks interest, too much glare, contrast doesn''t work for me', '2007-10-31 16:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4209048, 605598, 76598, '<td valign="top">The shadow ruins the picture</td>', 'The shadow ruins the picture', '2007-10-31 16:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4209107, 604740, 55956, '<td valign="top">ahahah a good trick to attract attention :)</td>', 'ahahah a good trick to attract attention :)', '2007-10-31 17:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4209146, 604406, 63269, '<td valign="top">The composition is a little akward - it''s always hard deciding how to crop up-close face pictures! But I like the simple colors and soft tones.</td>', 'The composition is a little akward - it''s always hard deciding how to crop up-close face pictures! But I like the simple colors and soft tones.', '2007-10-31 17:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4209148, 606753, 63269, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting and nice contrasts! I would suggest maybe not cropping quite so close to the subject''s side next time, although I do like the composition. Good shot!</td>', 'Beautiful lighting and nice contrasts! I would suggest maybe not cropping quite so close to the subject''s side next time, although I do like the composition. Good shot!', '2007-10-31 17:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4209156, 605068, 63269, '<td valign="top">Neat! This image could definitely use some more contrast, though. Or perhaps an adjustment in levels would work better - the black shades in this image are a little too washed out. They''re not really black. Also, I might suggest taking the shot a little further away. The camera seems to fill the whole frame, and therefore the composition isn''t very strong. Good try though, your shot has nice focus and lighting.</td>', 'Neat! This image could definitely use some more contrast, though. Or perhaps an adjustment in levels would work better - the black shades in this image are a little too washed out. They''re not really black. Also, I might suggest taking the shot a little further away. The camera seems to fill the whole frame, and therefore the composition isn''t very strong. Good try though, your shot has nice focus and lighting.', '2007-10-31 17:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4209161, 606530, 63269, '<td valign="top">I love the high-key effect here, absolutely beautiful! The bright red stick is a little distracting though - everything in the image is so soft and gentle, but the stick is bright and stands out so much in the image that it almost has the illusion of floating in mid-air. Neat shot though! :)</td>', 'I love the high-key effect here, absolutely beautiful! The bright red stick is a little distracting though - everything in the image is so soft and gentle, but the stick is bright and stands out so much in the image that it almost has the illusion of floating in mid-air. Neat shot though! :)', '2007-10-31 17:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4209173, 606671, 63269, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! I LOVE the colors here, and the little sparkles of light in the kitten''s eyes and in the fur. Very beautiful. My only complaint is the way the white makes on her face almost appear to have a blue tint. I''m guessing here, but perhaps you adjusted selective color to get the color of those beautiful blue eyes, and then the white turned a little bluish as well. Or perhaps your white balance was off on the camera. Either way, this gives the image an almost cold, poorly-lit feel to it. But if that could be fixed, this is a lovely image! :)</td>', 'Beautiful! I LOVE the colors here, and the little sparkles of light in the kitten''s eyes and in the fur. Very beautiful. My only complaint is the way the white makes on her face almost appear to have a blue tint. I''m guessing here, but perhaps you adjusted selective color to get the color of those beautiful blue eyes, and then the white turned a little bluish as well. Or perhaps your white balance was off on the camera. Either way, this gives the image an almost cold, poorly-lit feel to it. But if that could be fixed, this is a lovely image! :)', '2007-10-31 17:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4209178, 606250, 63269, '<td valign="top">The background is slightly distracting... the black strip on the top of the photo hinders some of the image''s impact. Otherwise, the point of view is excellent here, and I like the colors and lighting - nice capture.</td>', 'The background is slightly distracting... the black strip on the top of the photo hinders some of the image''s impact. Otherwise, the point of view is excellent here, and I like the colors and lighting - nice capture.', '2007-10-31 17:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4209181, 604740, 63269, '<td valign="top">A new thing to vote one. :) Not sure <i>how </i> to vote on it though... It''s funny, but not photographic, of course.</td>', 'A new thing to vote one. :) Not sure how  to vote on it though... It''s funny, but not photographic, of course.', '2007-10-31 17:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4209190, 605989, 85969, '<td valign="top">nice detail!</td>', 'nice detail!', '2007-10-31 17:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4209194, 606466, 85969, '<td valign="top">love this one, really simple but great focus and light</td>', 'love this one, really simple but great focus and light', '2007-10-31 17:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4209195, 605772, 85969, '<td valign="top">very cute!</td>', 'very cute!', '2007-10-31 17:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4209197, 605481, 85969, '<td valign="top">love the color composition</td>', 'love the color composition', '2007-10-31 17:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4209199, 604849, 85969, '<td valign="top">love the backlighting very original</td>', 'love the backlighting very original', '2007-10-31 17:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4209201, 606712, 85969, '<td valign="top">the composition could have been a little more interesting</td>', 'the composition could have been a little more interesting', '2007-10-31 17:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4209202, 606831, 63269, '<td valign="top">My first suggestion would be to choose a different background... a solid color might have been less distracting. Also, this image''s composition isn''t very exciting. Perhaps an unusual, different point of view would also help. And just as an idea, you might try adding some other things to this image - for example you could try putting a jar of salsa and a bowl on the side, and almost create a "still life" of sorts. Interesting idea though, keep trying! ;)</td>', 'My first suggestion would be to choose a different background... a solid color might have been less distracting. Also, this image''s composition isn''t very exciting. Perhaps an unusual, different point of view would also help. And just as an idea, you might try adding some other things to this image - for example you could try putting a jar of salsa and a bowl on the side, and almost create a "still life" of sorts. Interesting idea though, keep trying! ;)', '2007-10-31 17:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4209203, 606662, 85969, '<td valign="top">very artistic</td>', 'very artistic', '2007-10-31 17:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4209204, 606637, 85969, '<td valign="top">really nice, looks like its underwater, i like</td>', 'really nice, looks like its underwater, i like', '2007-10-31 17:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4209205, 605230, 85969, '<td valign="top">cool lighting</td>', 'cool lighting', '2007-10-31 17:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4209208, 606642, 85969, '<td valign="top">a little over saturated but cool in an artistic way</td>', 'a little over saturated but cool in an artistic way', '2007-10-31 17:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4209209, 604484, 63269, '<td valign="top">I love it! The contrast between the silvery, cold moon, and the golden lights is enthralling. I only wish the reflection from the moon on the water couldn''t be seen. It is difficult to make out what it is at first glance, and hinders the impact of the image a little. Lowering the camera might have eleminiated that... but I''m just getting picky. :) This is <i>very </i>neat!</td>', 'I love it! The contrast between the silvery, cold moon, and the golden lights is enthralling. I only wish the reflection from the moon on the water couldn''t be seen. It is difficult to make out what it is at first glance, and hinders the impact of the image a little. Lowering the camera might have eleminiated that... but I''m just getting picky. :) This is very neat!', '2007-10-31 17:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4209210, 604866, 85969, '<td valign="top">NEAT</td>', 'NEAT', '2007-10-31 17:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4209213, 604682, 85969, '<td valign="top">really grainy try turning your iso down</td>', 'really grainy try turning your iso down', '2007-10-31 17:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4209214, 605712, 85969, '<td valign="top">just beautiful well done</td>', 'just beautiful well done', '2007-10-31 17:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4209219, 606106, 63269, '<td valign="top">I''m not quite sure how this meets the challenge... unless it''s new snow? I''m sorry. As for the technical points, it''s a nice image. It would be neat to see the green a little brighter and more colorful, but the lighting is awesome!</td>', 'I''m not quite sure how this meets the challenge... unless it''s new snow? I''m sorry. As for the technical points, it''s a nice image. It would be neat to see the green a little brighter and more colorful, but the lighting is awesome!', '2007-10-31 17:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
