(4209226, 606120, 63269, '<td valign="top">IMO, the red fence is a little distracting, although I''m sure it was probably difficult enough as it was, trying to get this shot, without worrying about backgrounds. I would also suggest either exadgerating the tilt a little more for an even more unusual perspective, or just straightening the horizon. Just a thought. :) Neat capture!</td>', 'IMO, the red fence is a little distracting, although I''m sure it was probably difficult enough as it was, trying to get this shot, without worrying about backgrounds. I would also suggest either exadgerating the tilt a little more for an even more unusual perspective, or just straightening the horizon. Just a thought. :) Neat capture!', '2007-10-31 17:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4209227, 605816, 85108, '<td valign="top">good family portraite a bit dark and bluish guessing from the enclosure lights</td>', 'good family portraite a bit dark and bluish guessing from the enclosure lights', '2007-10-31 17:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
