(4214604, 606774, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful B/W.  I sort of wish the boy to the left were in as sharp a focus as the boy on the right, but otherwise, a delightful image.</td>', 'Beautiful B/W.  I sort of wish the boy to the left were in as sharp a focus as the boy on the right, but otherwise, a delightful image.', '2007-11-02 02:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214612, 604682, 5112, '<td valign="top">The image looks like it has quite a bit of artifacting, I don''t know if that is intentional, but to my eyes it is a tad distracting.  The connection to "something new" is a bit on the weak side.  Otherwise, I really like the shot!  A different look at geraniums, it is not usually a flower that is shown from underneath.  The colours are quite beautiful also.  ~7</td>', 'The image looks like it has quite a bit of artifacting, I don''t know if that is intentional, but to my eyes it is a tad distracting.  The connection to "something new" is a bit on the weak side.  Otherwise, I really like the shot!  A different look at geraniums, it is not usually a flower that is shown from underneath.  The colours are quite beautiful also.  ~7', '2007-11-02 02:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214620, 606456, 5112, '<td valign="top">I love his expression, even the posture of the hands matches his eyes/mouth!  The light is a bit harsh here, and the side in the shadow a bit too dark.  This is a nice image that would benefit from better lighting.  ~6</td>', 'I love his expression, even the posture of the hands matches his eyes/mouth!  The light is a bit harsh here, and the side in the shadow a bit too dark.  This is a nice image that would benefit from better lighting.  ~6', '2007-11-02 02:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214626, 606451, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done.  Unfortunately for me, the connection to "new" comes primarily from the title (I wouldn''t know that this fragrance is new if your title didn''t say so).  What I really like about the image is how the colours go so well with the name of the perfume, "waterfalls", and even the composition, a roundish bowl-shape holding the little bottle, sort of like water falling over rocks.  Really well done.  ~9</td>', 'Beautifully done.  Unfortunately for me, the connection to "new" comes primarily from the title (I wouldn''t know that this fragrance is new if your title didn''t say so).  What I really like about the image is how the colours go so well with the name of the perfume, "waterfalls", and even the composition, a roundish bowl-shape holding the little bottle, sort of like water falling over rocks.  Really well done.  ~9', '2007-11-02 02:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214629, 605759, 5112, '<td valign="top">Yeah, or light right before the evening comes on.  Beautifully backlit, good control of colours (they''re hard to control in this situation).  ~8</td>', 'Yeah, or light right before the evening comes on.  Beautifully backlit, good control of colours (they''re hard to control in this situation).  ~8', '2007-11-02 02:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214632, 605230, 5112, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately for me, if it weren''t for your title, I wouldn''t have the faintest idea that this is a "new" bedroom :)  But, since titles are an integral part of the picture .... ~6</td>', 'Unfortunately for me, if it weren''t for your title, I wouldn''t have the faintest idea that this is a "new" bedroom :)  But, since titles are an integral part of the picture .... ~6', '2007-11-02 02:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214639, 606823, 5112, '<td valign="top">I think the light in this image is a bit dull, the kids need to either be more of a silhouette, or have better clarity.  Also, the connection to "new" is weak - it depends entirely on the title.  The bright clouds/light at bottom right is beautiful!  ~6</td>', 'I think the light in this image is a bit dull, the kids need to either be more of a silhouette, or have better clarity.  Also, the connection to "new" is weak - it depends entirely on the title.  The bright clouds/light at bottom right is beautiful!  ~6', '2007-11-02 02:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
