(4216713, 605230, 63269, '<td valign="top">I really like what you''ve captured here. There are some cozy nights in my own bedroom or in other rooms of my house that are so thrilling and contented, that I desperately want to try and capture the good memories and the sweet atmospheres in a photograph. But I can''t. Your image <i>has </i>captured that sensation though. It makes me want to curl up and read that book. :) VERY well done!</td>', 'I really like what you''ve captured here. There are some cozy nights in my own bedroom or in other rooms of my house that are so thrilling and contented, that I desperately want to try and capture the good memories and the sweet atmospheres in a photograph. But I can''t. Your image has captured that sensation though. It makes me want to curl up and read that book. :) VERY well done!', '2007-11-02 20:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
