(4216723, 605265, 63269, '<td valign="top">I think this really has some potential....<br/> <br/>First of all, the quality seems very low. I can see actual pixels. If there were any way to fix that, that would be awesome. Also,  the mist and fog looks so neat with the tree branches and houses, but that is almost completely cut off. Getting some more of the ground into the image and perhaps creating some interesting composition (having the sun off in a corner instead of dead center) could make this an awesome image! Very good try! :)</td>', 'I think this really has some potential.... First of all, the quality seems very low. I can see actual pixels. If there were any way to fix that, that would be awesome. Also,  the mist and fog looks so neat with the tree branches and houses, but that is almost completely cut off. Getting some more of the ground into the image and perhaps creating some interesting composition (having the sun off in a corner instead of dead center) could make this an awesome image! Very good try! :)', '2007-11-02 20:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4216726, 605989, 63269, '<td valign="top">It almost looks slightly blurry... but I like the clear lighting and the bright colors.</td>', 'It almost looks slightly blurry... but I like the clear lighting and the bright colors.', '2007-11-02 20:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4216727, 606617, 63269, '<td valign="top">I like how the textures of the blanket almost, but not quite, match the texture of the puppy''s fur. Neat shot! Very cute. :)</td>', 'I like how the textures of the blanket almost, but not quite, match the texture of the puppy''s fur. Neat shot! Very cute. :)', '2007-11-02 20:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4216732, 604682, 63269, '<td valign="top">I wonder how this might look if the flowers were off to the side? Or even all the way in an upper corner of the photo. I love the grain here - it adds a lovely, brooding mood, which is contrasted strangely by the  bright colors. And for some reason, I like how you cut of the top of the flower. :D Perhaps because it''s so unusual, and gives the rather over-photographed subject a totally new perspective. good job. :)</td>', 'I wonder how this might look if the flowers were off to the side? Or even all the way in an upper corner of the photo. I love the grain here - it adds a lovely, brooding mood, which is contrasted strangely by the  bright colors. And for some reason, I like how you cut of the top of the flower. :D Perhaps because it''s so unusual, and gives the rather over-photographed subject a totally new perspective. good job. :)', '2007-11-02 20:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4216735, 605598, 63269, '<td valign="top">Interesting shadow-play here... it would be nice if there wasn''t a shadow over the center of the flower, but otherwise this is very neat!</td>', 'Interesting shadow-play here... it would be nice if there wasn''t a shadow over the center of the flower, but otherwise this is very neat!', '2007-11-02 20:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
