(4219564, 606637, 85155, '<td valign="top">I think the background is too out of focus, mostly because it is hard to get my orientation as to where this really is.  Is that in water, or is that just something blue in the background?  Sure, its pretty, but what makes it new?</td>', 'I think the background is too out of focus, mostly because it is hard to get my orientation as to where this really is.  Is that in water, or is that just something blue in the background?  Sure, its pretty, but what makes it new?', '2007-11-04 01:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219565, 605759, 85155, '<td valign="top">I think your position of the flower is great, but the background is so out of focus it actually hurts my eyes to look at this picture too long.  I think it is good to have a shallow dof to pick out the single flower, but this is a bit too much for me.</td>', 'I think your position of the flower is great, but the background is so out of focus it actually hurts my eyes to look at this picture too long.  I think it is good to have a shallow dof to pick out the single flower, but this is a bit too much for me.', '2007-11-04 01:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219568, 605489, 85155, '<td valign="top">This is too dark, it is hard to get any detail out of the top third of the picture.  Also the light in the bottom left is distracting.  What is new about this?</td>', 'This is too dark, it is hard to get any detail out of the top third of the picture.  Also the light in the bottom left is distracting.  What is new about this?', '2007-11-04 01:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219570, 606585, 85155, '<td valign="top">Nice macro shot here, I''m not entirely convinced this is better in b&amp;w, but I would have to see the color version to know for sure.</td>', 'Nice macro shot here, I''m not entirely convinced this is better in b&w, but I would have to see the color version to know for sure.', '2007-11-04 01:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219574, 605989, 85155, '<td valign="top">I like the droplets here, nice job capturing this shot.  I just wish that the green wasn''t blocking the bud right in the front of the shot.  Moving around the flower slightly would make this shot even better.</td>', 'I like the droplets here, nice job capturing this shot.  I just wish that the green wasn''t blocking the bud right in the front of the shot.  Moving around the flower slightly would make this shot even better.', '2007-11-04 01:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219576, 604974, 85155, '<td valign="top">I wish there was a little more contrast in the colors here.  It is way too blue for me.  Nice composition though.</td>', 'I wish there was a little more contrast in the colors here.  It is way too blue for me.  Nice composition though.', '2007-11-04 01:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219578, 606393, 85155, '<td valign="top">What is that on the right?  I can''t tell if it is behind the carpet, or in front of it, either way it is distracting.  I like the colors here, but it doesn''t seem like an interesting subject.</td>', 'What is that on the right?  I can''t tell if it is behind the carpet, or in front of it, either way it is distracting.  I like the colors here, but it doesn''t seem like an interesting subject.', '2007-11-04 01:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219581, 606826, 85155, '<td valign="top">I like the colors here, and the sun-rays are great too.  I think this is an all around great shot.</td>', 'I like the colors here, and the sun-rays are great too.  I think this is an all around great shot.', '2007-11-04 01:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219583, 606799, 85155, '<td valign="top">That is an oddly shaped woman, I guess that is what I''m looking at.  Anyway, nice job on the silhouette, and I really like the purple tone to the sky.  What is new about your subject though?  I can see the theme a lot of people are using with the sunrise, but your subject here isn''t the sunrise as much as it is these two figures.</td>', 'That is an oddly shaped woman, I guess that is what I''m looking at.  Anyway, nice job on the silhouette, and I really like the purple tone to the sky.  What is new about your subject though?  I can see the theme a lot of people are using with the sunrise, but your subject here isn''t the sunrise as much as it is these two figures.', '2007-11-04 01:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219585, 606642, 85155, '<td valign="top">I like the urban acid feel to the picture, how did you do it within the basic rules?  I''m not sure the ball really fits here though, why is it covering his head?</td>', 'I like the urban acid feel to the picture, how did you do it within the basic rules?  I''m not sure the ball really fits here though, why is it covering his head?', '2007-11-04 01:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219586, 606662, 84106, '<td valign="top">real bad entries in this challenge.  finally I get originality. great composition. 9.</td>', 'real bad entries in this challenge.  finally I get originality. great composition. 9.', '2007-11-04 01:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219587, 604836, 85155, '<td valign="top">I still can''t tell what I''m looking at.  This looks more old than new.  I think the shadows take away from this shot.  I like the dof though.</td>', 'I still can''t tell what I''m looking at.  This looks more old than new.  I think the shadows take away from this shot.  I like the dof though.', '2007-11-04 01:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219588, 606586, 85155, '<td valign="top">I don''t really like the blown out sky (is that the sky?) at the end here, that seems to be where the shot is leading me to, and then there is nothing there but white.  What is new about this?  Is it being re-constructed?  I do like the lines formed by the different beams, and the ceiling.</td>', 'I don''t really like the blown out sky (is that the sky?) at the end here, that seems to be where the shot is leading me to, and then there is nothing there but white.  What is new about this?  Is it being re-constructed?  I do like the lines formed by the different beams, and the ceiling.', '2007-11-04 01:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219589, 605990, 85155, '<td valign="top">What makes these new?  Are they really new?  It looks like there is a blue smudge on one of them.  I like the lines formed by her legs, nice composition.  I think the colors could use a little bit of work.</td>', 'What makes these new?  Are they really new?  It looks like there is a blue smudge on one of them.  I like the lines formed by her legs, nice composition.  I think the colors could use a little bit of work.', '2007-11-04 01:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219590, 606725, 85155, '<td valign="top">New York has been around a long time, what is new about this one?  I really like this shot though, the colors are great and your pov is great.</td>', 'New York has been around a long time, what is new about this one?  I really like this shot though, the colors are great and your pov is great.', '2007-11-04 01:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219593, 606804, 85155, '<td valign="top">What in the picture references something new here?  Without your title I have no idea.  I like how this is composed though, the matador is in the right spot, and you are capturing the action of the event.</td>', 'What in the picture references something new here?  Without your title I have no idea.  I like how this is composed though, the matador is in the right spot, and you are capturing the action of the event.', '2007-11-04 01:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219594, 605607, 85155, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of this bud.  I like the dof, and the pink against all the green, nicely done.</td>', 'Nice shot of this bud.  I like the dof, and the pink against all the green, nicely done.', '2007-11-04 01:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219742, 604740, 79141, '<td valign="top">nothing here .............  so it got a 1</td>', 'nothing here .............  so it got a 1', '2007-11-04 02:29:43.000000', NULL, 1);
