(4223276, 604441, 76430, '<td valign="top">Hmmm....what''s a Dawing?  OK I get it.  Nice silhouettes of the Joshua Trees and starburst on the rising sun.  I remember as a child our family used to travel through the Mohave Desert and when we went through Joshua Tree I always got tired because it looked like the trees were yawning and stretching.</td>', 'Hmmm....what''s a Dawing?  OK I get it.  Nice silhouettes of the Joshua Trees and starburst on the rising sun.  I remember as a child our family used to travel through the Mohave Desert and when we went through Joshua Tree I always got tired because it looked like the trees were yawning and stretching.', '2007-11-05 15:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4223286, 605266, 76430, '<td valign="top">Drying chilis on a Playstation 2?  They don''t get that hot do they?  Nice chili coloring and DOF.</td>', 'Drying chilis on a Playstation 2?  They don''t get that hot do they?  Nice chili coloring and DOF.', '2007-11-05 15:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
