(4226069, 606390, 20330, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot. I love the lighting on the shrooms and the variety of sizes. I almost expect little fairies to jump out and prance around.. its a lovely shot and definitely meets the challenge of New, moreso than most in this challenge. 9</td>', 'I really like this shot. I love the lighting on the shrooms and the variety of sizes. I almost expect little fairies to jump out and prance around.. its a lovely shot and definitely meets the challenge of New, moreso than most in this challenge. 9', '2007-11-06 19:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
