(4226077, 606250, 20330, '<td valign="top">love the fisheye. the dof is nice, it is technically well shot and the subject (due to the lens used) is comical and overall it makes for a great shot.</td>', 'love the fisheye. the dof is nice, it is technically well shot and the subject (due to the lens used) is comical and overall it makes for a great shot.', '2007-11-06 19:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4226093, 605481, 20330, '<td valign="top">one of my favorites from this challenge. i love the colors, the way you didn''t have a rainbow of colors but a variety of the same hues. also love the round pastel in the middle, the focus is good, and the shot meets the challenge. My only critique would be the background. I would either like to see this on a crisp white backdrop, commercial shot/stock, or something unique.. the gray is drab and takes away some of the beauty of the earth tones. overall a pleasing shot, have fun with your new pastels!</td>', 'one of my favorites from this challenge. i love the colors, the way you didn''t have a rainbow of colors but a variety of the same hues. also love the round pastel in the middle, the focus is good, and the shot meets the challenge. My only critique would be the background. I would either like to see this on a crisp white backdrop, commercial shot/stock, or something unique.. the gray is drab and takes away some of the beauty of the earth tones. overall a pleasing shot, have fun with your new pastels!', '2007-11-06 19:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4226097, 605838, 20330, '<td valign="top">the props and lighting are really good. If Stanley were posed a bit better.. lying down, looking at the camera, etc, the shot would be much better. Its a really nice set up.</td>', 'the props and lighting are really good. If Stanley were posed a bit better.. lying down, looking at the camera, etc, the shot would be much better. Its a really nice set up.', '2007-11-06 19:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
