(4226327, 606312, 39349, '<td valign="top">BFC: <br/> <br/>Couple of things about this shot that I would have done differently.<br/> <br/>First I think what''s really hurting you here is the composition. It seems that this is a beautiful Maple tree leaf but I''m really left trying to figure that out on my own. Perhaps a top down shot at it to show off it''s detail. <br/> <br/>Second, the stool or wood that you''ve chosen to lay it on is distracting. The line pulls my eye back toward the tree trunk and blown out sky. Again I would suggest centering the leaf in the center of the stool / table and contrast the leaf with the wood grain.<br/> <br/>Finally, your image has nice saturation and contrast, you''re on the right track by trying different angels and perspectives stay with that. A couple of minor tweaks and you''ll be right there in the running. <br/> <br/>Keep up the good work and good luck!</td>', 'BFC:  Couple of things about this shot that I would have done differently. First I think what''s really hurting you here is the composition. It seems that this is a beautiful Maple tree leaf but I''m really left trying to figure that out on my own. Perhaps a top down shot at it to show off it''s detail.  Second, the stool or wood that you''ve chosen to lay it on is distracting. The line pulls my eye back toward the tree trunk and blown out sky. Again I would suggest centering the leaf in the center of the stool / table and contrast the leaf with the wood grain. Finally, your image has nice saturation and contrast, you''re on the right track by trying different angels and perspectives stay with that. A couple of minor tweaks and you''ll be right there in the running.  Keep up the good work and good luck!', '2007-11-06 21:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4226335, 606483, 39349, '<td valign="top">Small white balance adjustment or curves would help this out greatly.</td>', 'Small white balance adjustment or curves would help this out greatly.', '2007-11-06 21:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4226339, 606585, 79657, '<td valign="top">Very nice concept from the bumble bee''s perspective. I feel like the image will have more impact if it''s in color. I also don''t see enough details on the petals and there are some noise in the background. A little improvement by using noise reduction software, getting closer to the subject to avoid massive crop, or keeping low ISO will help ^.~</td>', 'Very nice concept from the bumble bee''s perspective. I feel like the image will have more impact if it''s in color. I also don''t see enough details on the petals and there are some noise in the background. A little improvement by using noise reduction software, getting closer to the subject to avoid massive crop, or keeping low ISO will help ^.~', '2007-11-06 21:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4226343, 606605, 39349, '<td valign="top">BFC:<br/> <br/>Composition is too centered for my taste. Image seems a bit blurry as well as noisy, try a tripod and if you can set your ISO to a lower setting to reduce noise. <br/> <br/>Saturation seems nice and I like your choice of DOF. Good luck and keep shooting!</td>', 'BFC: Composition is too centered for my taste. Image seems a bit blurry as well as noisy, try a tripod and if you can set your ISO to a lower setting to reduce noise.  Saturation seems nice and I like your choice of DOF. Good luck and keep shooting!', '2007-11-06 21:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4226352, 604441, 39349, '<td valign="top">BFC:<br/> <br/>Love the silhouette and the star burst of the sun. What''s really hurting this shot is the border. It''s fighting for my attention against your beautiful landscape.<br/> <br/>Good luck and keep shooting!</td>', 'BFC: Love the silhouette and the star burst of the sun. What''s really hurting this shot is the border. It''s fighting for my attention against your beautiful landscape. Good luck and keep shooting!', '2007-11-06 21:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4226358, 606782, 79657, '<td valign="top">Beautiful girl and lovely expression ^.^ I find the chair on the left is a little bit distracting. My eyes keep going to the chair or to the overexposed spots on the right side. Maybe by removing them will let our eyes focus on the girl''s expression. Thank you for sharing.</td>', 'Beautiful girl and lovely expression ^.^ I find the chair on the left is a little bit distracting. My eyes keep going to the chair or to the overexposed spots on the right side. Maybe by removing them will let our eyes focus on the girl''s expression. Thank you for sharing.', '2007-11-06 21:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4226373, 606346, 39349, '<td valign="top">BFC:<br/> <br/>Okay I''m really glad that I''ve come back to leave a few comments on this challenge because I would have totally messed up this vote for sure. I gave this a 4 on my first run through of voting! A huge WHOOPS on my part.<br/> <br/>This shot is simply stunning! Great motion capture of the wing and the shallow DOF really pulls your eye into this little guy. I''m really diggin the sharpness of his head and breast. I might have cropped a little more off the left but that is just a matter of opinion.<br/> <br/>Saturation and contrast are dead on. A wonderful capture that this voter is glad he came through for a second look!<br/> <br/>A BIG bump up!</td>', 'BFC: Okay I''m really glad that I''ve come back to leave a few comments on this challenge because I would have totally messed up this vote for sure. I gave this a 4 on my first run through of voting! A huge WHOOPS on my part. This shot is simply stunning! Great motion capture of the wing and the shallow DOF really pulls your eye into this little guy. I''m really diggin the sharpness of his head and breast. I might have cropped a little more off the left but that is just a matter of opinion. Saturation and contrast are dead on. A wonderful capture that this voter is glad he came through for a second look! A BIG bump up!', '2007-11-06 21:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4226383, 606625, 77838, '<td valign="top">Different angles here, but I kinda like it.  BB</td>', 'Different angles here, but I kinda like it.  BB', '2007-11-06 21:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4226386, 606344, 77838, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, love it.    BB<br/> <br/>PS. Go Leroy!</td>', 'Nice idea, love it.    BB PS. Go Leroy!', '2007-11-06 21:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4226392, 605838, 77838, '<td valign="top">Brilliant colors! Very nice.  BB</td>', 'Brilliant colors! Very nice.  BB', '2007-11-06 21:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4226397, 605561, 77838, '<td valign="top">Sweet orange reflection.  I like how you have no background distractions reflected too.   BB</td>', 'Sweet orange reflection.  I like how you have no background distractions reflected too.   BB', '2007-11-06 21:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4226407, 604740, 77838, '<td valign="top">Amazing!  Not quite sure how it''s "something new" but it IS a "new idea"!!   BB</td>', 'Amazing!  Not quite sure how it''s "something new" but it IS a "new idea"!!   BB', '2007-11-06 21:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
