(4227154, 606826, 84520, '<td valign="top">Two ribbons from one location...come on now, where is this :)</td>', 'Two ribbons from one location...come on now, where is this :)', '2007-11-07 01:29:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(4227166, 606826, 5112, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Sachlichkeit:</b></div><hr/><i> Two ribbons from one location...come on now, where is this :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Medicine Lake, Alberta, in the Canadian Rockies.  Medicine Lake is not too far from Jasper, on the north end of Jasper National Park, on the road to Maligne Lake.  It''s an interesting lake because it has a very large underground drainage system.  At the time I was there, this side of the lake had water, but further down the lake there were a lot of areas with no water, more like running channels, and lots of animal tracks in the sandy soil.  It was quite cold though, but beautiful.</td>', 'Originally posted by Sachlichkeit: Two ribbons from one location...come on now, where is this :)   Medicine Lake, Alberta, in the Canadian Rockies.  Medicine Lake is not too far from Jasper, on the north end of Jasper National Park, on the road to Maligne Lake.  It''s an interesting lake because it has a very large underground drainage system.  At the time I was there, this side of the lake had water, but further down the lake there were a lot of areas with no water, more like running channels, and lots of animal tracks in the sandy soil.  It was quite cold though, but beautiful.', '2007-11-07 01:32:47.000000', NULL, 0),
