(4241625, 606456, 52992, '<td valign="top">Baby photo was my idea for this challenge too.  But seeing as my baby Bear is closing in on a year old already, I didn''t feel he would be seen as something "new" anymore".<br/> <br/>Too bad that this was a Basic Editing challenge, because I think with just a touch more tuning, this could be an excellent shot (ie - bringing out those eyes just a bit with some careful dodging, taking care of the cluttered background).  His expression is priceless though.</td>', 'Baby photo was my idea for this challenge too.  But seeing as my baby Bear is closing in on a year old already, I didn''t feel he would be seen as something "new" anymore". Too bad that this was a Basic Editing challenge, because I think with just a touch more tuning, this could be an excellent shot (ie - bringing out those eyes just a bit with some careful dodging, taking care of the cluttered background).  His expression is priceless though.', '2007-11-12 16:14:17.000000', NULL, 0),
